+/*
+ * NOTE:  terminology here is confusing.
+ *
+ *  - This driver supports the "Audio Serial Port" (ASP),
+ *    found on dm6446, dm355, and other DaVinci chips.
+ *
+ *  - But it labels it a "Multi-channel Buffered Serial Port"
